Third-party software and assets
-------------------------------
ClinBridge uses, but does not include in this repository, open-source packages
installed from npm (see package.json). Each keeps its own licence. The built
app (dist/) bundles code from these packages, among others:

- React, React DOM, React Router (MIT)
- Firebase JS SDK, including Firebase AI Logic and App Check (Apache-2.0)
- Dexie and dexie-react-hooks (Apache-2.0)
- Material Symbols icon font (Apache-2.0, Copyright Google LLC)
- Inter typeface via @fontsource/inter (SIL Open Font License 1.1,
  Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors, https://github.com/rsms/inter).
  The font files remain under the OFL 1.1, not the Apache License.

Design and artwork
------------------
- The colour and type tokens (tailwind.stitch.json, docs/STITCH_DESIGN.md) and
  the unused reference figures in src/features/body/art/ came from a Google
  Stitch design export supplied by the project owner for this project.
- The illustrations in src/assets/medical/ were cut from an AI-generated
  reference image supplied by the project owner for this project
  (see docs/ASSETS.md).
- The body-map anatomy in src/features/body/anatomy.ts and the app icon
  public/icon.svg are original vector artwork made for ClinBridge.

All patients, staff and records in the Practice data are fictional.
